<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pioneer Hi-Bred said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pioneer Hi-Bred said cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities analyst John McMillin downgraded Pioneer Hi-Bred International Inc to hold from buy, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not available and analyst's office declined to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-3/16 to 78-13/16.</p>
</text>
